 up. Bit hard to chill when you’ve got a king in your face telling you there’s a bad guy you've gotta go slay or whatever, you know? Plot twist, though — it's actually not so bad. Getting the hero treatment sounds pretty nice, right? But then it happens again! Some other clown summons me, I get my obligatory superpower, and off I go.\r\n\r\nAnd sure, that's fine. It happens, sometimes you get isekai'd to the wrong place. But then it happens AGAIN! Someone ELSE summons me, I get ANOTHER superpower, and then I'm somewhere totally new. Repeat ad nauseam. No idea what's going on, but all I want is one thing: stop !@#$ing summoning me!\r\n___\r\n[Official English Light Novel](https://j-novel.club/series/oversummoned-overpowered-and-over-it)","year":2020,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/802bf297-b156-4053-8542-f12057c4a7b9/dbd5339d-dda0-42db-9738-ab95f25164e0.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","pt-br","fr","es-la","pl","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.02,"follows":60535,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:21.699Z","chapters":[{"id":"f4c20cd6-fae8-4f48-8143-84bab20f6196","number":"38","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2024-07-16T05:13:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ca190a5f-f2a4-40f7-b967-c13e17cb85c5","number":"37","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2024-07-16T05:13:41+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b0445d35-a6a1-4c20-afda-f77a9685a54c","number":"36","volume":"8","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2024-07-16T05:13:28+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f93c8eef-9dde-4bbc-bf57-a1dd343112ac","number":"35","volume":"8","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":44,"createdAt":"2024-07-16T05:13:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bcca7b38-ed02-4356-991e-796eafb7deef","number":"34","volume":"8","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2024-07-16T05:09:04+00:00","baked":false}